source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q43"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |  Limit: skip=1000, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Sort: M ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |     Projection: date_part(Utf8("minute"),from_unixtime(hits.EventTime)) AS M, count(Int64(1)) AS PageViews                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[date_part(Utf8("minute"), from_unixtime(hits.EventTime))]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[EventTime], full_filters=[hits.CounterID = Int64(62), hits.EventDate >= Utf8("2013-07-14"), hits.EventDate <= Utf8("2013-07-15"), hits.IsRefresh = Int64(0), hits.DontCountHits = Int64(0)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=hits compute_context=//data/hits.turso base_sql=SELECT strftime('%M', datetime(`hits`.`EventTime`, 'unixepoch')) AS `M`, count(1) AS `PageViews` FROM `hits` WHERE (((((`hits`.`CounterID` = 62) AND (`hits`.`EventDate` >= '2013-07-14')) AND (`hits`.`EventDate` <= '2013-07-15')) AND (`hits`.`IsRefresh` = 0)) AND (`hits`.`DontCountHits` = 0)) GROUP BY strftime('%M', datetime(`hits`.`EventTime`, 'unixepoch')) ORDER BY `M` ASC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
